0-944e-1954b3f251f5","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":270983263,"PostDateInt":1789615076000,"PostDate":"2026-09-17T11:17:56","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级前端开发工程师","OrgId":3378254,"Org":"系统开发与运营智能部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市·南山区"],"Salary":"15K-30K 元/月","Duty":"1. 产品终极交付：主导核心 Web/全栈产品的前端架构与体验交付，不局限于“前端”界限，以端到端的产品结果为最终导向。\n2. AI 工具与流程重塑：熟练将 AI 编程工具（如 Cursor、Claude Code、Copilot 等）深度融入日常开发流程，持续提效，并带动团队提升 AI 杠杆率。\n3. 复杂系统架构与体验打磨：打造高性能、高可用、极致体验的用户界面，攻克复杂交互、跨端协同、性能瓶颈等硬核工程难题。\n4. 自驱探索与技术创新：主动发现业务与技术痛点，自驱发起重构与创新项目，把技术的热爱转化为产品的终极竞争力。","Require":"1. 热爱与心气 ：对做“伟大产品”有极强的执念，有极客精神，对技术演进保持饥饿感，能主动为最终用户体验负责。\n2. 极强自驱与自我管理：不依赖事无巨细的任务拆解，具备极强的“去职能化”思维，遇到问题能自主探索、闭环解决。\n3. AI Native 思考能力：深刻理解 AI 对软件工程的改变，具备优秀的 AI 提问与上下文构建能力（Prompting & Context Engineering），能用 AI 提升数倍交付效率。\n4. 硬核前端功底：精通 JavaScript/TypeScript、Modern Web 框架（React/Vue 体系）及底层原理，对前端性能优化、设计模式、复杂架构有深入理解。\n5. 全栈与跨界视角：不画地为牢，具备 Node.js/Serverless 或全栈延伸能力，能从全局视角设计系统。\n6. 统招本科以上学历，5年以上相关工作经验。","ClassificationOne":"产品研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-17T11:17:56","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"